  2016 Titus Wormer, MIT License
  (style/data/licenses/retext-redundant-acronyms.txt). One acronym and expansion
  per line, converted from JavaScript to tab-separated text.
- style/data/cliches/proselint.txt and style/data/redundancy/proselint-ras.tsv:
  proselint/checks/cliches/hell.py and proselint/checks/redundancy/ras_syndrome.py
